Soldiers of Erenor look to Kyrios, the god of death and destruction, as their patron. In his name a battlerager charges into the thick of the fight, closes the distance with leaps and pulls and cuts down everything within reach.

'''Battlerage''' is a primary DPS [[Skill Trees|skill tree]] with a heavy emphasis on close-range physical damage. It has several gap closers and some crowd control of its own, so it works with almost any other tree.

== Skills ==
=== Combat skills ===
{{TreeSkills|Battlerage|combat}}

=== Passive skills ===
Passives cost 1 skill point each and unlock after you have spent the listed number of points in Battlerage.
{{TreeSkills|Battlerage|passives}}

=== Abyssal skills ===
The [[Abyssal Skills]] have to be unlocked through a questline and don't require skill points to be used.
{{TreeSkills|Battlerage|abyssal}}

